    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22020" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γερωνία</span></b>  and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γερωχία</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γερωΐα</span>
			. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γερώνοιον:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοῖλον, κενόν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γέσμα:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γεῦμα</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γέστα:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γογγυλίς</span>, Id.:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γεστία:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔνδυσις</span>, and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γέστρα:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στολή</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γέτορ:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔτος</span>, and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γέτος:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνιαυτός</span>, Id. (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ</span>
			=
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ϝ</span>). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γεῦ:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυνὸν τὶ ἄρα</span>, Id.</div>
